{"id":"f09541c13d757646","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process.md","title":"ZFC Inner4 Comparison Process","display":"df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process — ZFC Inner4 Comparison Process","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process","aliases":["58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process"],"display":"df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process — ZFC Inner4 Comparison Process","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process — ZFC Inner4 Comparison Process"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd \\in V\">\\(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S \\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S \\subseteq V^8\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}process}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,\\{\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\ell))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Last},\\{\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\},\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\unlhd\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\ell(\\mathcal T))\n\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,N,\\ell(\\mathcal U))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\n\\langle\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal T),\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal U)\\rangle\\in\\unlhd\n\\lor\n\\langle\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal U),\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal T)\\rangle\\in\\unlhd\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}process}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,\\{\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\ell))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Last},\\{\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\},\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\unlhd\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\ell(\\mathcal T))\n\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,N,\\ell(\\mathcal U))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\bigl(\n\\langle\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal T),\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal U)\\rangle\\in\\unlhd\n\\lor\n\\langle\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal U),\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal T)\\rangle\\in\\unlhd\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The length map, last-model map, candidate premice, and comparison relation are explicit data.</li>\n<li>This predicate records a successful comparison witness: two iteration trees whose last models are comparable by the premouse initial-segment relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-iteration-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S \\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}inner4\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}process}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\ell,\\{\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\},\\operatorname{ran}(\\ell))\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\operatorname{Last},\\{\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\},\\mathcal B)\n\\land\\unlhd\\subseteq\\mathcal B\\times\\mathcal B\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\ell(\\mathcal T))\n\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,N,\\ell(\\mathcal U))\\\\\n&\\land\\bigl(\n\\langle\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal T),\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal U)\\rangle\\in\\unlhd\n\\lor\n\\langle\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal U),\\operatorname{Last}(\\mathcal T)\\rangle\\in\\unlhd\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1645,"backlinks":[{"id":"6a328d4ba618668b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"09268699702789db","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2380","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process.md|58-df-zfc-inner4-comparison-process]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["92fbda0605a6cb98","36d7463d215be751"]}